module BugListIndexFallbackSortOrder.

> Regression for #376: list-index fallback constants must be declared only
> after the user-domain sorts used by their result types.

Value.
Container.
items container: Container => [Value].
---
all container: Container, index: Nat, index <= #(items container) |
  (items container) index = (items container) index.

> Keep a bounded instance in the structural regression query: the consistency
> pass intentionally skips the unbounded-Nat invariant above in some configs.
all container: Container |
  (items container) 1 = (items container) 1.
